      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Love it so, so much, love it so, so much",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Love it so, so much, love it so, so much",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Does it mess you up? Does it mess you up?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Got my career on my mind",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Money drop in New York City",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Look in the mirror, and I'm like",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "\"So hot, so smart, so witty\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Mentally in a gun fight",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Thank God I keep so busy",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Some things you know I'll never show, oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "And my heart was like an open sore",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Saw, like, twenty healers when I was on tour",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Told me everything I need, I got",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And the cherry on top",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I am nobody's girl, I love it so much",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It's exactly what I wanted, oh-oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I am nobody's girl, does it mess you up",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "That you had it, and you lost it? Nobody",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "How many times can I shape-shift into someone else?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "No, there's no line when art turns to need serious help",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And when the job calls, gotta get it done",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Gotta put myself second to none",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "At twenty-two, it's a little sad",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But it's fun",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
