      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Nobody's in my head tonight",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Nobody's sayin' wrong or right",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Baby, please, won't you see my side?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Baby, please, won't you see my side?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And when I ask, the angels sing (Baby, please, won't you see my side?)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "They say, \"Real love doesn't clip your wings\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I love love and affection and fancy things (Baby, please, won't you see my side?)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "But I think I like me more",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And when I cry, gotta wonder why (Baby, please, won't you see my side?)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Every tear's in the shape of mankind",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "When one closes, the universe opens a new door, now I",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
